  "bio": "Jerin Tribe Tattoo, located in the heart of Berlin, Germany, is renowned for their exceptional professionalism in the tattoo industry. Specializing in linework, blackwork, dotwork, minimalist, and ornamental tattoos, with a unique flair for tribal and vegan styles, they maintain a rigorous standard of professionalism that ensures every client's experience is top-notch. Their studio, Kayon Tattoo Atelier, is a testament to their dedication to both the art and the client.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Berlin, Berlin, Germany\n\nTattoo Artist • Berlin 🇩🇪  \nCustom Freehand • Polynesian • Linework • Tattoo \nResident at @kayon_tattoo_atelier  \n🗓️ Bookings via DM or Telegram",
